def streams():
    return '''<div class="research-streams"><article class="stream"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Forecasting with stability.</h3><p>How can demand forecasts stay accurate while becoming more consistent inputs to replenishment and resource planning?</p><p class="keywords">Demand forecasting · Machine learning</p></article><article class="stream"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Decisions under uncertainty.</h3><p>How should causal evidence, incomplete information, and operational constraints shape which action comes next?</p><p class="keywords">Causal decision support · Optimization</p></article><article class="stream"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Recovery with context.</h3><p>How can unstructured return notes inform targeted inspection and resource recovery when labor is scarce?</p><p class="keywords">Semantic signals · Reverse logistics</p></article></div>'''


