    return '''<div class="timeline"><article class="timeline-item"><p class="timeline-date">Jun 2024 — Present<br>Seattle, Washington</p><div><h3>Accenture</h3><div class="role-title">Data Science Consultant</div><p>Forward and reverse logistics for a technology client, connecting operational analysis with planning and execution.</p><ul class="plain-list"><li>Lead planning analyses, manage client relationships, and present recommendations to senior leaders.</li><li>Use SQL to analyze cycle times and on-time delivery, identify bottlenecks, and support reuse, resale, recycling, and disposal decisions.</li><li>Analyze demand, stock targets, and available inventory; use optimization to rebalance supply across sites.</li><li>Plan quality-assurance component quantities using demand and bill-of-materials data; define service metrics and support inventory adjustments.</li><li>Standardize prompts and analytical queries for enterprise LLM assistants, develop reusable guides, and train analysts in AI-assisted analysis.</li></ul></div></article><article class="timeline-item"><p class="timeline-date">Oct 2021 — May 2024<br>Seattle, Washington</p><div><h3>Accenture</h3><div class="role-title">Data Science Senior Analyst</div><ul class="plain-list"><li>Built SQL dashboards and shortage alerts to compare inventory with demand and inform transfers between sites.</li><li>Tracked reverse-logistics cycle times and delivery performance to support recovery scheduling.</li><li>Investigated inventory imbalances and abnormal cycle times with statistical analysis; automated reporting and purchase-order workflows.</li></ul><p>Across both Accenture roles, mentored five junior analysts in SQL, business problem solving, and client communication.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-item"><p class="timeline-date">Feb — Aug 2021<br>Cambridge, Massachusetts</p><div><h3>BMW Group</h3><div class="role-title">Data Scientist Intern · MIT Capstone</div><p>Modeled vehicle demand and cross-price elasticity in Python to recommend discounts by customer segment and sales channel. Built Tableau dashboards to make pricing insights usable.</p></div></article></div>'''


